      "extract": "Borel transform [@Borel] is an important tool in the study of non-perturbative phenomena. It is used to extract information from divergent series which typically arise in perturbative expansions. Non-perturbative partition functions depend on extra parameters, like the choice of integration contour, this dependence seems to disappear in perturbative expansion, but is in fact traded for divergence of the series. New",
      "extractCut": true
