      "extract": "The main Gaussian measure ([\\[Gm\\]](#Gm){reference-type=\"ref\" reference=\"Gm\"}) itself enjoys a curious property: it can be expanded into a simple sum over the Schur functions containing only self-conjugated Young diagrams: $$\\begin{aligned} \\label{Gmex} d\\mu \\sim \\exp\\left\\{-\\sum_{k=1}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{p_{2k-1}^2-2p_{2k-1}}{2(2k-1)} + \\frac{p_{2k}^2}{4k}\\right)\\right\\}",
